	</string>
	<string id="ui_mm_desc_gamepad_calib">
		<text>Live calibration screen for sticks (LS/RS/UI) and triggers (LT/RT): deadzones, saturation thresholds, response curves and camera turn speeds. The profile is saved in appdata\gamepad\profile.ltx.</text>
	</string>
