	</string>
	<string id="ui_mm_desc_gamepad_remap">
		<text>Context-aware button remapping (Tap, Hold, Chord), conflict detection, protected Menus &amp; Inventory navigation, layout Export/Import, and Custom Controller Setup Wizard (saved in appdata\gamepad\user_mappings.txt).</text>
