	<string id="ui_mm_control_gamepad_x_target_angle_desc">
		<text>How close to a use hint (stash, body, NPC, door) the crosshair must be for a short X to skip reloading. 0 = only exactly on the hint. Gamepad only: within this radius the use hint and Dot Marks already show the object and X/F use it, without exact aiming. Mouse and keyboard work as in the original game.</text>
