	<string id="ui_mm_control_gamepad_ammo_wheel_max_types_desc">
		<text>How many compatible ammo types the Ammo Wheel shows for the current weapon (1 to 6, default 3). The Ammo Wheel is on by default. If there are more compatible types, the currently loaded type comes first, then ammo from the backpack and loaded magazines, sorted by quantity.</text>
	</string>
